tllama-server (0.7.0~dev+b11850.1-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Pin native 0e9433bfd3 for the combined memory, model and legacy HIP build.
  * Include deduplicated weight-storage ranges and bounded opt-in tensor
    diagnostics in memory API V1, independently of buffer capacities.
  * Add experimental Instella-MoE conversion and native model support.
  * Export successful CUDA/HIP and SYCL/Level Zero allocation paths, retaining
    fallback provenance, context lifetime and conservative locality evidence.
  * Publish defined allocation-device attributes in the server report.
  * Include native gfx900, gfx906 and gfx90c HIP targets with optional matching
    ROCm 10.1 BLAS addons; document unqualified paths and coverage limits.
  * Rebuild the core and every backend against the same native snapshot.

